1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:54,560
Qiu Siping said

25
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:57,120
that this cave belonged to an ancient cultivator.

26
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:59,960
Maybe one of these texts has hints about the Ji Realm.

27
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,320
Found it !

28
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,720
There is only a single way to overcome

29
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,960
the limits of the Ji Realm:

30
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:18,200
Abandon the cultivation the Ji Realm granted you.

31
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,800
Shatter your cultivation.

32
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,280
After shattering your cultivation,

33
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:23,040
the Ji Realm will dissipate.

34
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:26,280
This is the only way to escape the Ji Realm.

35
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,760
Cultivate from zero

36
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,520
and redo all your breakthroughs.

37
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:33,600
Does that mean that you need to discard your Ancient God body ?

38
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,080
Not necessarily.

39
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:39,640
The Divine Path... So this is the Divine Path !

40
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:42,720
Create an avatar to cultivate simultaneously with the main body

41
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:45,200
and merge the two bodies to form a Nascent Soul.

42
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:51,880
I can use the Divine Path to create an avatar and form my Nascent Soul.

43
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:54,000
How is that any different ?

44
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:57,160
Master, the avatar must also cultivate from scratch

45
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:58,840
to the Nascent Soul breakthrough

46
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:01,360
and merge with the original body to attempt to form a Nascent Soul.

47
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:03,360
I wasn't able to form an avatar before

48
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,560
because I didn't have enough pills and artifacts.

49
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,920
With the harvest from the Land of the Ancient God,

50
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:10,280
this looks like the perfect time and place to try.

51
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:12,200
It's too risky !

52
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:14,760
The avatar's lifespan will only be 30 years !

53
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:17,160
If you don't form a Nascent Soul within 30 years,

54
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:19,240
it will all be for nothing !

55
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,050
Besides...

56
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,560
No need to discuss this any further,

57
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:23,080
I must form Nascent Soul in order to get revenge.

58
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:46,080
The country of Chu is at the north of the Burning Fire country

59
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:48,400
and at the east of the country of Xuanwu.

60
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:50,720
It also shares a border with the Sea of Devils

61
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:53,640
next to the Broken Rocks Mountains.

62
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:55,440
Its territory is vast

63
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:57,520
and is populated by many cultivators.

64
00:04:58,080 --> 00:05:00,040
Even if it's just a rank 3 country,

65
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:04,680
it's at the pinnacle of rank 3 countries thanks to the Cloud Sky Sect,

66
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:06,280
Cloud Sky Sect
Country of Chu

67
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:07,840
a major sect specialized in alchemy.

68
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:13,760
It will eventually produce a Soul Formation cultivator and rise to rank 4.

69
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:20,280
Cheng Fei
Sword Qi Sect disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

70
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:26,160
Cheng Ling
Early stage Foundation Establishment

71
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,640
We are still 1000 li away,

72
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,160
why did we land here ?

73
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:29,080
If I want to become a disciple

74
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,760
then why do I have to walk ?

75
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,560
Keep your voice down,

76
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:34,640
everyone else is walking too.

77
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:36,840
This is a show of respect towards the sect.

78
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:45,040
Big Brother, why do you want me to join the Cloud Sky Sect ?

79
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:46,760
I don’t want to refine pills,

80
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:49,000
I want to join Sword Qi Sect like you !

81
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,480
Don't say that.

82
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:52,080
You know that

83
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:54,560
the Cloud Sky Sect is the strongest in the country of Chu.

84
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:57,440
The Cloud Sky Sect once refined a grade 5 pill.

85
00:05:57,880 --> 00:06:00,480
In order to buy that pill, a rank 4 country

86
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:03,640
specially created a formation for the Cloud Sky Sect

87
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:06,760
that even ordinary rank 4 countries would struggle to break.

88
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:08,400
What do you think now ?

89
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:12,320
Well, that does pique my interest a bit.

90
00:06:12,850 --> 00:06:14,020
Very well,

91
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,640
once I join the Cloud Sky Sect,

92
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:16,560
I will make pills

93
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,840
to help you in your cultivation.

94
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:20,200
You...

95
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:23,440
Do you think entering Cloud Sky Sect will be easy ?

96
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:25,760
They only recruit every 30 years.

97
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:29,200
Not only do major families of Chu send their descendents here

98
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:31,680
but many rogue cultivators also try their chance.

99
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,600
Thousands will participate

100
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,440
but less than 10 will be accepted.

101
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,840
Don’t worry,

102
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:38,160
a girl as adorable as me

103
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,280
is sure to be chosen.

104
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:41,800
You might not know

105
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:43,920
but the Cloud Sky Sect's recruitment is quite peculiar.

106
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:46,760
Unlike other sects that value talent and spiritual roots,

107
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:48,440
they value fate.

108
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,840
Big Brother, look at that person !

109
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:52,000
Why are his clothes are so funny ?

110
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:57,760
Hey, are you here to join the sect as well ?

111
00:06:57,920 --> 00:07:00,320
Why are you dressed like a beggar ?

112
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:06,040
Hey, are you mute ?

113
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,240
I’m talking to you.

114
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,520
It's a pointless question.

115
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:10,800
Why else would I be heading to the Cloud Sky Sect ?

116
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,960
Wang Lin's avatar
3rd layer of Qi Condensation

117
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,120
You...

118
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:15,760
You’ve always been spoiled for being cute

119
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:17,520
but you rarely get ignored.

120
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,360
Let’s go.

121
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:27,000
It’s been so long since I felt the fatigue of a mortal.

122
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,440
Master,

123
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:31,600
why must you participate in this disciple selection ?

124
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:34,040
I came out of the Sea of Devils

125
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,600
specifically for this place.

126
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,360
If I can become a sect disciple,

127
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,880
I will use the Cloud Sky Sect's help

128
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:41,040
to form my Nascent Soul.

129
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:48,680
The will of the heavens is unpredictable...

130
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:52,720
I never thought that I'd join a sect again one day.

131
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,040
Incredible !

132
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:05,200
Among the candidates

133
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:07,440
there are 2nd and 3rd layers of Qi Condensation

134
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:10,560
and also people up to Core Formation.

135
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:34,360
Zhou Lin
Cloud Sky Sect 9th generation disciple
Early stage Core Formation

136
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:36,520
If you wish to join the Cloud Sky Sect,

137
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,480
your seniority will be low.

138
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:42,600
If you’re not willing, then leave now.

139
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:48,680
Since no one left,

140
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,320
then let's start.

141
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:54,560
The Cloud Sky Sect’s disciple selection begins now !

142
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,400
It’s starting, it’s starting !

143
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:09,280
Using whatever method you choose,

144
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:13,560
as long as you can feel what substance is inside this pillar

145
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:17,040
then you'll be qualified.

146
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:20,520
You have 6 hours.

147
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,880
I saw nothing !

148
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,280
Watch me !

149
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:52,800
My artifact !

150
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:53,840
He lost his artifact ?

151
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:56,920
You may use any method you can think of.

152
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:58,680
Don’t worry,

153
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:02,200
your artifacts will be returned after the selection.

154
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:04,200
My turn !

155
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:05,840
I’ll try too !

156
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:08,560
Me too !

157
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,240
I don't believe it !

158
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:20,120
Master, why aren’t you moving yet ?

159
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:23,840
There clearly is some kind of restriction to prevent anyone from probing.

160
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,400
What a coincidence,

161
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:29,840
you’re an Enlightened of Ancient God restrictions.

162
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:32,320
Even if this avatar doesn't have your cultivation,

163
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:35,960
you still have all the memories of the Ancient God.

164
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,120
Master is truly impressive.

165
00:10:39,280 --> 00:10:41,200
Even without his cultivation or Ji Realm,

166
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:43,960
he still has a domineering aura around him.

167
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:52,680
11 Eleven pills,

168
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:55,120
11 jade slips

169
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:58,160
and 11 tokens engraved with pill furnaces.

170
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,360
Why are there different items ?

171
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:01,760
Wait...

172
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:06,400
the Cloud Sky Sect isn't selecting experts in restrictions.

173
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:11,800
Someone found it ?

174
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:12,600
Look over there !

175
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,080
How did she do it ?

176
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:15,240
She's no ordinary girl.

177
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:17,880
So you can actually take these things out ?

178
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:21,080
You pass.

179
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:25,480
So the real selection has nothing to do with the candidate.

180
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:27,960
It's the items inside that choose the disciples.

181
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,560
The 3 kinds of items

182
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,760
correspond to 3 different outcomes.

183
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,480
What are the outcomes ?

184
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,800
We won't know until we try.

185
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:43,960
I... I passed !

186
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:47,960
It's a pity this pill is of the fire element.

187
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:50,680
Otherwise, I could've been your teacher.

188
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:54,200
Congratulations on becoming an inner disciple of the Cloud Sky Sect.

189
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,880
Keep this pill.

190
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:59,360
The jade slip means you pass this trial

191
00:11:56,640 --> 00:11:58,440
You will give it to your teacher

192
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:01,720
and the pill makes you an inner disciple directly.

193
00:11:58,560 --> 00:12:00,200
to thank him for accepting you as disciple.

194
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:04,880
Then what is the token ?

195
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:08,040
Only 1 hour is left before the end of the test.

196
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:10,240
I can tell you

197
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:13,320
that there are 4 types of items in this pillar.

198
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:18,440
Jade slips, pills, tokens, and a pill furnace.

199
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,640
A pill furnace ?

200
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,680
Those who obtain jade slips

201
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:23,960
pass this test.

202
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:25,960
Those who obtain a pill

203
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,840
directly become inner sect disciples

204
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:29,440
Those who obtain a token

205
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:31,600
also become inner disciples

206
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:35,760
and can exchange the token for a grade 3 pill.

207
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:38,360
If you can obtain the pill furnace,

208
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:43,120
you will become a core disciple directly under the Sect Leader.

209
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:47,000
Master, quickly find it !

210
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,720
Everyone will admire you !

211
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,400
You'll have countless pills !

212
00:12:50,560 --> 00:12:51,520
I won't waste time.

213
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:56,320
Being an inner disciple is enough.

214
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:57,440
Water element !?

215
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:01,480
Will you be my disciple ?

216
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:08,400
Then I’ll accept this gift.

217
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:11,360
I got one too !

218
00:13:11,400 --> 00:13:12,280
I also have one !

219
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:13,640
You got one ?

220
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:14,440
Look at mine !

221
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:25,400
The Dragonborn Furnace !

222
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,640
A Sect Leader disciple will appear !--

223
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:31,960
Who is this lucky ?

224
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:32,560
Look up there !

225
00:13:36,640 --> 00:13:37,560
What happened ?

226
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,280
Still, he failed.

227
00:13:40,160 --> 00:13:42,240
Over the past 8000 years of the Cloud Sky Sect

228
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:45,880
only 6 Seniors ever got the pill furnace.

229
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:52,560
Sometimes, you need a little luck in life.

230
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:55,040
But you can't rely on luck alone.

231
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:57,720
This concludes this test of the disciple selection.

232
00:13:58,440 --> 00:14:00,520
Those who failed will be escorted out.

233
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,320
Those who obtained items,

234
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:03,840
follow me up the mountain.

235
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:05,040
Understood !

236
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:20,040
Such a domineering pill furnace...

237
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:29,040
The buildings are entirely made of jade.

238
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:32,000
This alchemy sect must be really wealthy !

239
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:43,000
Such abundant spiritual energy !

240
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:45,760
The Cloud Sky Sect really is an excellent place for cultivation.

241
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:08,160
Song Qing
Cloud Sky Sect Leader
Middle stage Nascent Soul

242
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:10,880
9th generation disciple Zhou Lin, pays respects to Sect Leader.

243
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:16,360
Here are the 6 who passed the disciple selection.

244
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,720
3 obtained jade slips

245
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:20,240
2 obtained pills

246
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:21,800
and 1 obtained a token.

247
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:26,680
Those who obtained jade slips

248
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:30,360
will have to undergo a second test

249
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:33,960
to decide whether they become inner disciples.

250
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:34,520
Understood.

251
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:36,520
Those who obtained pills

252
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:39,040
will take 9th generation disciples as their teacher.

253
00:15:39,640 --> 00:15:42,280
Junior Sun, you choose your disciple first.

254
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,080
Thank you, Sect Leader.

255
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:52,760
Sun Zhenwei
9th generation Cloud Sky Sect disciple
Late stage Core Formation

256
00:15:57,280 --> 00:16:00,360
Sect Leader, disciple wishes to take this person as disciple.

257
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:02,520
He obtained a water element pill

258
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:05,320
that perfectly matches my current needs for alchemy.

259
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:11,840
Junior Sun, are you willing to yield this person ?

260
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:15,280
Zhou Lin is Elder Li’s only disciple.

261
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:16,920
Naturally, I wish to help him.

262
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:18,880
Thank you.

263
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:21,960
Then who will you choose ?

264
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:27,280
Disciple pays respects to Teacher.

265
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:30,480
You haven’t obtained inner disciple qualifications yet.

266
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:32,080
You can't choose your teacher yet.

267
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:37,120
This girl is quite clever.

268
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,520
Although you only obtained a jade slip,

269
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:41,360
your courage is commendable.

270
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:44,560
I’ll make an exception and take you as my disciple.

271
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,480
As for the inner disciple,

272
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:49,640
I'll take him.

273
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:50,640
Sect Leader,

274
00:16:50,760 --> 00:16:52,040
is this acceptable ?

275
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:54,280
This... this is against the sect's rules.

276
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:57,200
No problem, no problem.

277
00:16:57,520 --> 00:16:59,600
Since Junior Sun has spoken,

278
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,800
then let it be so.

279
00:17:04,120 --> 00:17:04,520
But...

280
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:05,640
You're dismissed.

281
00:17:06,360 --> 00:17:07,160
Understood.

282
00:17:14,600 --> 00:17:17,280
The Cloud Sky Sect is divided into the inner and outer sect.

283
00:17:17,880 --> 00:17:19,200
The inner sect refines pills

284
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,680
and the outer sect guards it.

285
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:22,920
Since you are an inner disciple,

286
00:17:23,320 --> 00:17:25,920
you will focus on alchemy.

287
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:29,120
Such extravagance !

288
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:31,600
There are so many precious plants

289
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:33,520
in this disciple's garden !

290
00:17:34,320 --> 00:17:35,120
Wang Lin,

291
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:37,360
you are my first disciple.

292
00:17:37,760 --> 00:17:38,760
From now on,

293
00:17:39,120 --> 00:17:40,920
you will live in this room.

294
00:17:41,560 --> 00:17:43,240
I will go in seclusion for several months

295
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:44,880
to absorb the Water Spirit Pill.

296
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,440
You will find

297
00:17:46,640 --> 00:17:49,080
my insights on alchemy inside this jade slip

298
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:50,360
along with pill formulas.

299
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:52,000
Read them for yourself.

300
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:55,680
I will teach you personally when I come out.

301
00:17:57,120 --> 00:17:58,520
You may freely use

302
00:17:58,720 --> 00:18:00,080
the herbs in this garden.

303
00:18:00,280 --> 00:18:02,120
But remember, don’t uproot them.

304
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:04,760
And this furnace

305
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:07,880
is my greeting gift for you.

306
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:10,200
Thank you, Teacher !

307
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,320
During my seclusion,

308
00:18:12,640 --> 00:18:15,200
if you have any questions about alchemy,

309
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:16,920
go find your Grandteacher.

310
00:18:17,560 --> 00:18:19,120
She is very kind

311
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:21,160
and will explain to you the details

312
00:18:21,360 --> 00:18:23,880
about the inner workings of alchemy.

313
00:18:24,760 --> 00:18:25,400
Alright,

314
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:27,440
I should go now.

315
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:28,960
Just a heads up,

316
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,760
you’re still young

317
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,640
so while I’m in seclusion,

318
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:35,000
take good care of yourself

319
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:38,080
and remember to never cut corners.

320
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:43,600
This small pill furnace

321
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:48,280
is the same quality as the Hundred Beasts Spirit Furnace I traded for in the Sea of Devils.

322
00:18:50,040 --> 00:18:51,080
This cheap Master of yours

323
00:18:51,080 --> 00:18:52,360
is surprisingly kind.

324
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:17,520
Teacher, Teacher !

325
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:19,280
I have a disciple !

326
00:19:32,620 --> 00:19:36,500
I've had my share of wounds,

327
00:19:34,660 --> 00:19:36,500
now I want to fight back.

328
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:40,060
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

329
00:19:40,140 --> 00:19:45,980
that's blocking all my hopes

330
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:45,980
for life ?

331
00:19:47,780 --> 00:19:51,740
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

332
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:51,740
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

333
00:19:52,060 --> 00:19:55,140
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

334
00:19:55,500 --> 00:20:01,140
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

335
00:19:58,220 --> 00:20:01,140
out of reach.

336
00:20:02,500 --> 00:20:06,620
Immortals

337
00:20:03,540 --> 00:20:06,620
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

338
00:20:06,900 --> 00:20:10,660
Renegades

339
00:20:07,660 --> 00:20:10,660
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

340
00:20:10,660 --> 00:20:14,500
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

341
00:20:12,610 --> 00:20:14,500
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

342
00:20:14,740 --> 00:20:18,620
because I don't see the harm in that.

343
00:20:20,620 --> 00:20:26,420
My new body opens its eyes

344
00:20:23,140 --> 00:20:26,420
and awakens from its dream.

345
00:20:26,540 --> 00:20:33,980
I have overcome many trials

346
00:20:28,660 --> 00:20:33,980
to get this body back.

347
00:20:34,180 --> 00:20:41,620
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

348
00:20:38,220 --> 00:20:41,620
I can still see.

349
00:20:42,020 --> 00:20:50,980
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

350
00:20:45,980 --> 00:20:50,980
by my own hands.

351
00:21:06,420 --> 00:21:12,380
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

352
00:21:09,140 --> 00:21:12,380
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

353
00:21:12,380 --> 00:21:19,940
With a flick of a finger,

354
00:21:13,820 --> 00:21:19,940
only my indomitable heart remains.

355
00:21:19,980 --> 00:21:29,340
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

356
00:21:25,940 --> 00:21:29,340
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

357
00:21:29,580 --> 00:21:37,180
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

358
00:21:32,100 --> 00:21:37,180
like the descent of a god.
